Z||000016||DJRice||08-21-2001||09:49 PM||||If girls dont have a preference either way about the car and you ask them what they think then you probably are going to get a negative answer.  Unless you are (un)fortunate (that could go either way) enough to have a girl so vane that she likes you just for your car.<P>Silence gives consent.  If you dont ask her, and she doesnt volunteer the fact that she does not like it, then it is safe to assume that she is fine with it or actually likes it.<P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/djr_signature.jpg"> ||||reg||1
